{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-areaguide-detail-template-js","path":"/area-guides/reem-community/","result":{"data":{"strapiAreaGuide":{"id":"7b128477-5b36-5098-ab40-ef382fe2a304","description":{"data":{"description":"<p>Reem is inspired by nature’s palette, it embraces its indigenous landscape of texture and colours. The floriculture of Desert pervades the Reem Community that is been tempered with whispering water features and verdant alcoves.</p>"}},"video_ask_url":null,"amenities":{"strapi_json_value":["Near Golf Course"],"id":"de58c85d-1bc2-5507-a8bd-06fac7162fbe"},"title":"Reem Community","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/reem_community_feature_183121f790.jpg"},"masterplan_image":null,"sponsored_projects":[],"teams":[],"strapi_id":66,"slug":"reem-community","custom_property_slug":null,"publish":true,"more_info":[],"longitude":55.3350021,"latitude":25.0913238,"content":{"data":{"content":"<p>Reem Community in Dubai, developed by Emaar Properties, is a contemporary residential development known for its innovative design and scenic landscaping. Situated in the growing Dubailand district, this community offers a tranquil yet vibrant lifestyle, ideal for families and young professionals.</p><p>Reem features a variety of townhouses, set in a refreshing green environment. These homes are known for their spacious interiors, modern architecture, and quality finishes, offering residents comfort and style. The community is particularly noted for its signature feature, a desert botanical park, which includes sand surfing and camel riding trails.</p><p>Residents enjoy a range of amenities such as swimming pools, fitness centers, and children's play areas. Retail centers, schools, and healthcare facilities are conveniently located within the community, ensuring a comfortable living experience.</p>"}},"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/reem_community_feature_183121f790.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providen